II. Kubectl Pods - Broker
A. Connecting to broker pods

1. Go to Kubernetes services in the azure portal
2. Select Subscription all
3. Select dev-aks-clstr1
4. Click on Connect
5. Do az login form the terminal
6. Run first command as is (az account set --subscription 1b1a6248-7641-4360-8aa9-6e4a0f0ee052)
7. Run the second command, but append --admin at the end

B. Checking pod status

1. Run kubectl get pods -o wide -n broker  

